text Her body is still stiff, but her expression has eased.
text With her eyes closed, she looks even more like Fujibayashi.
text My sense of reason and the questions that were boiling in my mind fades away.
text Instead, I focus my vision at the tiny lips in front of my eyes.
text My heart is beating so strongly and quickly that I wonder if Kyou can hear it.
text Independent of my will, my body starts to move.
text Like I am being sucked toward Kyou.
text Like I am being drawn toward these tiny lips right before my eyes...
text I shut my eyes, and slowly bring my face forward.
text I can feel a hint of warmth drifting toward my dry lips.
text Just a little more, and they'll be touching...
text ...Just a little more─
